 kw='Primary: rescue litter (150/mo, KD0). Secondary: rope rescue stretcher (0-10), extraction stretcher (0-10), descent control stretcher (0, not indexed), multi purpose extraction stretcher (0). Ricky\'s note: not-indexed terms are real product language; use them in the copy, but do not expect volume. Also used: stair stretcher (80, from the REX ONE row).',
 kwlist=['rescue litter','stair stretcher','extraction stretcher','descent control','multi-purpose extraction stretcher','rope rescue'],
 h1='Rapid Extraction Wheeled Rescue Litter with Descent Control Brake for Stairs – REX DCS',
